# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Official ISTQB® source documents — must NEVER be committed.
# See docs/COPYRIGHT-RISK.md. Redistributing whole official PDFs is not an
# "extract" and is the single fastest way to attract a takedown.
#
# Strategy: ignore every PDF and Office document anywhere in the repo, then
# re-include only the guides this project generates itself.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.ppt

# Re-include the generated study guides and their rendered PDFs.
!guides/
!guides/**/
!guides/*.docx
!guides/pdf/*.pdf

# A convenient place to drop the official downloads while studying — ignored.
official/
sources/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build / tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
tools/node_modules/
package-lock.json
tools/package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS and editor cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.tmp
